# Release 1B — Round 15 Checksums
# Non-recursive integrity design:
#   - This file covers all other Round 15 artifacts.
#   - This file does NOT contain its own hash (non-recursive by design).
#   - The manifest (release1b_cp0_manifest.json) covers the script and
#     other artifacts but not itself; this file covers the manifest.
#
# R14 authoritative values are recorded in release1b_round14_review.md §A.
# R15 values below are PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION because R15 artifacts
# changed from R14 (the script and manifests were corrected) and SHA-256
# hashes cannot be computed within the tool interface.
#
# Operators must compute these values after downloading the artifacts
# and before executing the script in any mode.
#
# Computation commands (run from release1b_round15/ directory):
#   shasum -a 256 <filename>
#   wc -c < <filename>
#
# Format: SHA256  BYTES  FILENAME

PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_cp0.zsh
PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_cp0_manifest.json
PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_schema_manifest.json
PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_hook_manifest.json
PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_test_manifest.json
PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  PENDING_FINAL_STATIC_VALIDATION  release1b_round15_review.md

# NOTE: release1b_round15_checksums.sha256 (this file) is NOT listed above.
# Its hash must be recorded externally after all other values are filled.
